{"body":"I am using 63.0.1 firefox browser on windows 10. \r\n\r\nThis works https://justadudewhohacks.github.io/face-api.js/webcam_face_tracking on both chrome & firefox.\r\n\r\nbut when it is run locally by npm start. It is opening the camera, but not detecting face in firefox. It works fine in chrome. And no logs too.","canonical_uri":"https://github.com/justadudewhohacks/face-api.js/issues/129","number":129,"repository":"justadudewhohacks/face-api.js","updated_at":"2019-03-27T14:05:41Z"}